    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d519-a1">

                <pb facs="0605" n="509" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg509"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr. Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-26"><hi rendition="#italic">September 26,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: I have the honor to send to your
                    excellency a copy of 1he letter which, under date of yesterday, the President of
                    the Republic addressed to Mr. Charles U. Gordon, stating the reasons why he
                    excuses himself from assisting at the festivities which will take place in
                    Chicago, and designating me to represent him.</p>
                <p>I avail myself, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
